        <main id="site-main" class="site-main">
            <div class="container p-3 my-4 border shadow-sm">
                <div class="rich-v2 standard  clearfix" data-title="Barton Sports Hall of Fame Inductees" data-url="/information/halloffame/halloffame">
            <div class="article-body clearfix">
    <div class="container p-0">
        <div class="article-data d-flex  flex-row flex-sm-row  justify-content-between">
            <div class="article-data-inner position-relative w-100">
                <div class="article-top position-relative">
                                                                        <h1 class="article-title">Barton Sports Hall of Fame Inductees</h1>
                                    

                                                    
            
                        
                        
                        
                </div>
                <div class="article-info position-relative">
                    <div class="article-sidebar-image-float float-lg-end col-lg-6 ms-lg-4">
                                                                                                            </div>
                                            <div class="article-info-main flex-fill">
                        <div class="article-details mb-3">
                            <div class="article-post-metrics d-flex justify-content-start">
    <div class="article-post-metrics-box-1">
            
    </div>
    <div class="article-post-metrics-box-1">
            

    </div>
</div>

                        </div>
                        <div class="article-content">
                            <h6><strong>2026 Class (<a title="2026 Barton Sports Hall of Fame" href="/general/2025-26/releases/20260120u2buty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Erica (Harper) Robertson (Softball)</li>
<li>Lorin Miller (Men's Basketball Coach)</li>
<li>Inez Turner (Track and Field)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2025 Class (<a title="2025 Barton Sports Hall of Fame" href="/general/2024-25/releases/20250219wx7af2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Lacy (Frees) Draznik (Dance)</li>
<li>Natchapol "Putter" Srinoon (Men's Golf)</li>
<li>Tim Weiser (Baseball)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2024 Class (<a title="2024 Barton Sports Hall of Fame" href="/information/halloffame/2024/2024HOFCeremonyProgram.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Jackie Jones (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Kade Sander (Wrestling)</li>
<li>Neus Torregrosa (Women's Tennis)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2023 Class (<a title="2023 Barton Sports Hall of Fame" href="/information/halloffame/2023/CeremonyProgram.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Kevin Ellis (Men's Soccer)</li>
<li>Ebi Ere (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Ken "Doc" Henderson (Athletic Training)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2022 Class (<a title="2022 Barton Sports Hall of Fame" href="/information/halloffame/2022/HOFProgramWeb.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Jeff Beaman (Tennis)</li>
<li>David Foss (Contributor)</li>
<li>Christi (Ensz) Rife (Volleyball/Women's Basketball)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2021 Class</strong></h6>
<p style="padding-left: 30px;">*No induction class due to the Covid-19 pandemic</p>
<h6><strong>2020 Class (<a title="2020 Barton Sports Hall of Fame" href="/information/halloffame/2020/CeremonyProgram.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Dr. William and Lori Slater (Contributors)</li>
<li>Ipek Turkyilmaz (Women's Basketball)</li>
<li>Mike Warren (Baseball)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2019 Class (<a title="2010 Barton Sports Hall of Fame" href="/information/halloffame/2019/CeremonyProgram.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Shala Giardini (Women's Soccer)</li>
<li>Jimmy Graham (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Steve Griffin (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Joel Light (Men's Track and Field)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2018 Class</strong>&nbsp; (<a title="2018 Barton Athletics Hall of Fame Information" href="/information/halloffame/2018/CeremonyProgram.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</h6>
<ul>
<li>Randy Cole (Track and Field)</li>
<li>Tyson Gay (Men's Track and Field)</li>
<li>Clair Oleen (Men's Basketball)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2017 Class</strong>&nbsp; (<a title="2017 Barton Athletics Hall of Fame Information" href="/information/halloffame/2017/CeremonyProgram.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</h6>
<ul>
<li>Curtis Hammeke (Baseball)</li>
<li>DeMarcus Minor (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Lamont Roland (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Dr. Perry Smith (Contributor)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2016 Class</strong>&nbsp; (<a title="2016 Barton Athletics Hall of Fame Information" href="/information/halloffame/2016/2016HOFInduction" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</h6>
<ul>
<li>Joe Burger (Men's Soccer)</li>
<li>Caley (Carter) Knudsen (Volleyball)</li>
<li>Ray Seib (Track &amp; Field)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2015 Class</strong>&nbsp; (<a title="2015 Barton Athletics Hall of Fame Information" href="/information/halloffame/2015/2015HOFInduction" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</h6>
<ul>
<li>Gene Butler (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Jeff Christy (Baseball)</li>
<li>Pete Manely (Athletic Training)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2014 Class</strong>&nbsp; (<a title="2014 Barton Athletics Hall of Fame Information" href="/information/halloffame/2014/2014HOFInductionPostEvent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</h6>
<ul>
<li>L.T. and Sheila Fleske (Contributors)</li>
<li>Hyleas Fountain (Women's Track &amp; Field)</li>
<li>Leevan Sands (Men's Track &amp; Field)</li>
<li>Susan (Sundahl) Ryan (Women's Basketball)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2013 Class&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>(<a title="2013 Barton Athletics Hall of Fame Information" href="/information/halloffame/2013/CeremonyProgram.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</h6>
<ul>
<li>Kurt Budke (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Steve Johnson (Baseball)</li>
<li>Larry Schugart (Contributor)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2012 Class&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>(<a title="2012 Barton Athletics Hall of Fame Information" href="/information/halloffame/2012/CeremonyProgram.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Information</a>)</h6>
<ul>
<li>Pat Bauman (Multi-sport Coach)</li>
<li>Wayne Becker (Contributor)</li>
<li>Dennis Sherman (Men's Golf)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2011 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Tom Curtis (Softball)</li>
<li>George Donley (Broadcaster)</li>
<li>Trish (Gadberry) Wade (Volleyball)</li>
<li>Jim and Jo Ann Heaton (Contributors)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2010 Class</strong></h6>
<p style="padding-left: 30px;">*No induction class as there was a Hall of Fame Reunion coinciding with Barton's 40th Anniversary Celebration</p>
<h6><strong>2009 Class</strong> &nbsp;</h6>
<ul>
<li>Bill Murry (Contributor)</li>
<li>Gene Potts (Contributor)</li>
<li>Jason Sanford (Baseball)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2008 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Jack Bowman (Track Coach)</li>
<li>Sydney Bwalya (Men's Tennis)</li>
<li>Tom Stickney (Contributor)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2007 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Danny Biggs (Contributor)</li>
<li>David Chadd (Baseball)</li>
<li>Dick Nagy (Men's Basketball Coach)</li>
<li>Shauna (Struckhoff) Churchman (Volleyball, Women's Basketball)</li>
</ul>
<h6><strong>2006 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Dana Foss (Contributor)</li>
<li>Tony Hobson (Men's Basketball, Women's Basketball Coach)</li>
<li>Wendy (Okeson) Benisch (Women's Basketball)</li>
</ul>
<h6>&nbsp;<br>

 <strong>2005 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Derrick Brew (Men's Track &amp; Field)</li>
<li>Veronica (Campbell) Brown (Women's Track &amp; Field)</li>
<li>Suzie (Wiemers) Fritz (Volleyball)</li>
<li>Bernard Williams (Men's Track &amp; Field)</li>
</ul>
<h6>&nbsp; &nbsp;<br>

 <strong>2004 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Kristen (Crosby) Madden (Women's Basketball)</li>
<li>Walter Davis (Men's Track &amp; Field)</li>
<li>Nate Field (Baseball)</li>
<li>Kevin Sundahl (Contributor)</li>
<li>J.B. Webster (Contributor)</li>
</ul>
<h6>&nbsp; &nbsp;<br>

 <strong>2003 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Mark Hutton (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Dan McGovern (Men's Basketball Coach)</li>
<li>Michelle (Moores) Waller (Softball)</li>
<li>Harlan Spatz (Contributor)</li>
<li>Loren Unruh (Contributor)</li>
</ul>
<h6>&nbsp;<br>

 <strong>2002 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Ray Bechard (Volleyball Coach)</li>
<li>Mark Bell (Men's Basketball)</li>
<li>Michelle (Hall) Hulsmeyer (Volleyball)</li>
<li>Jimmy Lawson (Contributor)</li>
</ul>
<h6>&nbsp;<br>

 <strong>2001 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Scott Dean (Baseball)</li>
<li>Steve Gotsche (Men's Golf)</li>
<li>Archie Lindholm (Contributor)</li>
<li>Dennis Shaver (Track &amp; Field Coach)</li>
</ul>
<h6>&nbsp;<br>

 <strong>2000 Class</strong></h6>
<ul>
<li>Shane Cordell (Men's Track &amp; Field)</li>
<li>Dr. Jimmie Downing (Contributor)</li>
<li>Debbie (Johnson) Deem (Women's Basketball)</li>
<li>Jerry McCarty (Women's Basketball Coach)</li>
<li>Jerry Mullen (Men's Basketball Coach)</li>
<li>Larry Zinn (Contributor)</li>
</ul>


                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

            
